# QUICKSTATS: E-Commerce Data Analytics and Real-Time Monitoring System

## Project Overview

This project is a **E-Commerce Data Analytics and Real-Time Monitoring System** built using the **Olist E-Commerce Dataset**. The goal of the project is to analyze customer orders, payments, products, sellers, and reviews, and to generate **business insights and time-series forecasts** using statistical models (ARIMA).

The project combines:

* Data analysis (cleaned & structured datasets, based on Python)
* Interactive dashboard (Advanced Excel based)
* Forecasting using ARIMA
* Visual reports and alerts for decision-making

